# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/).
#
# Calculia is a fully static site with no API: activity data ships in
# `tools/<slug>/data.js`, strings in `tools/<slug>/strings.*.js`, the
# shared core lives in `assets/js/`, and everything else is HTML/CSS.
# The site uses a plain folder layout (no client-side router), so the
# only redirect we actually need is a 404 fallback so a stale path
# doesn't end up on Cloudflare's default JSON error.
#
# NOTE: 404 handling is also configured in `wrangler.toml` via
# `not_found_handling = "404-page"` (Workers + static assets path).
# This `_redirects` rule is the equivalent for the legacy Pages path
# if the project is ever flipped back to classic Pages.
/*
  status: 404